{
  "schemaVersion": "ride-output-v2.2.0",
  "label": {
    "text": "总距离 31.1 公里的骑行，平均速度 28.47 km/h",
    "conclusionType": "fact",
    "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:metric.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:speed.mean"]
  },
  "overallAssessment": {
    "text": "本次骑行总距离 31.1 公里，移动时长 1 小时 2 分钟，平均心率 168 bpm，平均踏频 79 rpm，整体呈现中等偏高的强度水平。",
    "conclusionType": "fact",
    "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:metric.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:timing.movingDurationS", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.mean"]
  },
  "highlights": [
    {
      "text": "全程平均速度 28.47 km/h，速度波动系数 18.6%，整体配速较高且节奏控制得当。",
      "conclusionType": "fact",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:speed.coefficientOfVariation"]
    }
  ],
  "dimensions": [
    {
      "dimensionId": "pacingExecution",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "本次骑行总距离 31.1 公里，移动时长 1 小时 2 分钟，平均速度 28.47 km/h，速度波动系数 18.6%，整体配速较高且节奏控制得当。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:metric.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:timing.movingDurationS", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:speed.coefficientOfVariation"]
        },
        {
          "text": "本次骑行包含 1 次停车，总用时 1 小时 6 分钟，移动时长 1 小时 2 分钟，停车时间有限。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:stops.count", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:metric.elapsedDurationS", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:timing.movingDurationS"]
        },
        {
          "text": "巡航段 1（2 分钟）平均速度 29.97 km/h，巡航段 2（2 分钟）平均速度 27.96 km/h，巡航段 3（3 分钟）平均速度 29.23 km/h，整体巡航速度较高。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.speed.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "地形以平路为主，平路距离 29 公里，下坡距离 1.6 公里，爬坡距离 0 公里，几乎全平路。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:terrain.trendFlatDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:terrain.trendDescentDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:terrain.trendClimbDistanceM"]
        },
        {
          "text": "本次可用数据有限，部分数据缺失，但整体配速分配前快后慢，速度波动系数 18.6%，速度变化较大。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:speed.coefficientOfVariation", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:speed.lastMinusFirst"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "heartRateLoad",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "平均心率 168 bpm，心率波动系数 9.2%，心率区间分布：Z1 2%、Z2 4%、Z3 15%、Z4 58%、Z5 21%，高强度区间（Z4-Z5）合计占比 78%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heart_rate.coefficientOfVariation", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z1", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z2", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z3", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z4", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z5", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.highIntensityCombined"]
        },
        {
          "text": "心率从开始到结束上升了 26.2 bpm，心率波动系数 9.2%，整体心率水平较高且呈上升趋势。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heart_rate.lastMinusFirst", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heart_rate.coefficientOfVariation"]
        },
        {
          "text": "巡航段 1（2 分钟）平均心率 159 bpm，巡航段 2（2 分钟）平均心率 174 bpm，巡航段 3（3 分钟）平均心率 175 bpm，巡航心率逐渐升高。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.heart_rate.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "本次骑行心率整体偏高，高强度区间占比 78%，属于高强度负荷的骑行。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.highIntensityCombined", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heart_rate.mean"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "cadenceStrategy",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "平均踏频 79 rpm，踏频波动系数 29.7%，踏频区间分布：零踏频 6%、低踏频 6%、稳定踏频 7%、耐力踏频 48%、高踏频 33%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.coefficientOfVariation", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.zero", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.low", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.steady", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.endurance", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.high"]
        },
        {
          "text": "踏频从开始到结束上升了 14.3 rpm，踏频波动系数 29.7%，踏频变化较大。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.lastMinusFirst", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.coefficientOfVariation"]
        },
        {
          "text": "巡航段 1（2 分钟）平均踏频 82 rpm，巡航段 2（2 分钟）平均踏频 88 rpm，巡航段 3（3 分钟）平均踏频 87 rpm，巡航踏频较高。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.cadence.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "本次骑行踏频整体偏高，但波动较大，部分数据缺失（功率数据缺失），踏频策略有待优化。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.coefficientOfVariation"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "crossSensorCoordination",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "速度与心率在同一时间窗口内的共同覆盖率为 100%（聚合值），代表性窗口 1 为 70%，窗口 2 为 100%，窗口 3 为 100%，速度与心率数据高度同步。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.aggregate", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.1", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.2", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.3"]
        },
        {
          "text": "速度与心率数据在时间上高度同步，但功率数据缺失，无法进一步分析效率。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.aggregate"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "suggestions": [
    {
      "text": "下次骑行可尝试在平路段保持踏频在 80-90 rpm 区间，以优化踏频策略。",
      "conclusionType": "suggestion",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.mean"],
      "riskNote": "踏频波动较大，需注意保持稳定输出。"
    },
    {
      "text": "鉴于本次心率高强度区间占比 78%，建议下次骑行适当降低强度，注意恢复。",
      "conclusionType": "suggestion",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.highIntensityCombined"],
      "riskNote": "高强度负荷可能增加疲劳风险。"
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.aggregate:AGGREGATED_FROM_123_WINDOWS",
    "power:SERIES_MISSING"
  ]
}
